{"beat": 2, "name": "LET THEM BE WRONG", "text": "Here's how most prices get set. Landed cost, times a markup that gives a gross margin you're comfortable with. A look at the competitors. Then a gut check: would I pay that. If units hold after a change, the price was fine. If units drop, it was too high, put it back. It's a fair method. It's what everyone does, and it isn't stupid, because units are the thing you can see. The thing you can't see is the line the units sit on, and the price you want is on that line, not on the markup.", "provider": "library", "words": [{"word": "Here's", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.29}, {"word": "how", "start": 0.325, "end": 0.406}, {"word": "most", "start": 0.488, "end": 0.697}, {"word": "prices", "start": 0.743, "end": 1.08}, {"word": "get", "start": 1.126, "end": 1.254}, {"word": "set.", "start": 1.3, "end": 1.8}, {"word": "Landed", "start": 2.183, "end": 2.519}, {"word": "cost,", "start": 2.577, "end": 3.216}, {"word": "times", "start": 3.332, "end": 3.634}, {"word": "a", "start": 3.669, "end": 3.692}, {"word": "markup", "start": 3.75, "end": 4.122}, {"word": "that", "start": 4.168, "end": 4.272}, {"word": "gives", "start": 4.319, "end": 4.528}, {"word": "a", "start": 4.574, "end": 4.598}, {"word": "gross", "start": 4.667, "end": 5.004}, {"word": "margin", "start": 5.074, "end": 5.41}, {"word": "you're", "start": 5.457, "end": 5.608}, {"word": "comfortable", "start": 5.631, "end": 6.06}, {"word": "with.", "start": 6.095, "end": 6.513}, {"word": "A", "start": 6.838, "end": 6.908}, {"word": "look", "start": 6.978, "end": 7.117}, {"word": "at", "start": 7.152, "end": 7.198}, {"word": "the", "start": 7.233, "end": 7.303}, {"word": "competitors.", "start": 7.338, "end": 8.162}, {"word": "Then", "start": 8.487, "end": 8.835}, {"word": "a", "start": 9.114, "end": 9.23}, {"word": "gut", "start": 9.3, "end": 9.474}, {"word": "check:", "start": 9.532, "end": 10.054}, {"word": "would", "start": 10.437, "end": 10.623}, {"word": "I", "start": 10.65